    "RARITY_TEXT": "UNCOMMON",
    "RARITY_ICON": "UNCOMMON",
    "ART_PROMPT": "A withered, blackened fig tree casting a long, dark shadow over barren, cracked soil, with a distant, brooding storm gathering in a bruised sky.",
    "ABILITY_TEXT": "Target player must discard a NOUN or NAME from their hand; if they cannot, they must reveal their hand.",
